                <note rend="inline" type="source">860p.512 Residence/9: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Latvia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Sussdorff</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-11-22T10:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 22,
                                1928—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received November 22—9:10
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>95. Your 68, November 21, 6 p.m. Tax in question does not apply to Latvian
                    nationals.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sussdorff</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
